{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0220","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:000000ff:text","row":30035,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"友貴がいた。","en":"Tomoki is here.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800840","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00001","en":"Tomoki was there.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:00000123:text","row":30036,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"保健室の中をうかがっている。","en":"He's peering into the infirmary.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800841","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00002","en":"He's peeping covertly into the infirmary.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:0000015f:text","row":30037,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"「友貴ー」","en":"“Tomoki!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800842","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00003","en":"Taichi: \"Tomokiii.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:00000181:text","row":30038,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"声をかけると、背中がびくりと跳ねた。","en":"When I call out, his back jerks.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800843","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00004","en":"I call out to him and his back sprung up with a start.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:00000243:text","row":30039,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"「た、太一か……」","en":"“T-Taichi...”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800844","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00005","en":"Tomoki: \"Ta-, it's Taichi...?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:00000275:text","row":30040,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"「学校にいたんだな」","en":"“So you were at school.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800845","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00006","en":"Taichi: \"You were at school then.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:00000327:text","row":30041,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"「ああ、ちょっと様子見に……ちょっとこっち」","en":"“Yeah. Just checking on something... Come over here.”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800846","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00007","en":"Tomoki: \"Ahhh, I came to see at how things are things a bit... c'mere a bit.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","typography"],"assessment":"The duplicated words make the English clause ungrammatical.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":53,"start":36,"text":"things are things"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:00000373:text","row":30042,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"「お？」","en":"“Oh?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800847","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00008","en":"Taichi: \"Oh?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:00000393:text","row":30043,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"連れて行かれる。","en":"He leads me away.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800848","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00009","en":"I go with him.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:000003e0:text","row":30044,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"「ここならいいかな」","en":"“This should be far enough.”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800849","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00010","en":"Tomoki: \"Should be fine here I guess.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:00000414:text","row":30045,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"「どうしてこんなはしっこに」","en":"“Why all the way out here?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800850","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00011","en":"Taichi: \"Why here in this corner?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:0000046d:text","row":30046,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"「……いや」","en":"“...No reason.”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800851","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00012","en":"TomokI: \"...well.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:00000491:text","row":30047,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"口ごもる。","en":"He falters.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800852","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00013","en":"He hesitates to say.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:000004bb:text","row":30048,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"「で、平和維持活動部はどう？」","en":"“So, how's the Peacekeeping Activities Club?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800853","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00014","en":"Taichi: \"So, how's the Peace-Keeping Club going?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:00000577:text","row":30049,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"「生命維持活動部。そっちはなんとか」","en":"“Life-Support Activities Club. We're managing somehow.”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800854","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00015","en":"Tomoki: \"Life Maintenance and Improvement Club! That's going somehow.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["addition","word_choice"],"assessment":"The club name in Japanese contains life-maintenance activities; 'Improvement' is not present.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":41,"start":26,"text":"and Improvement"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:00000639:text","row":30050,"ordinal":16,"kind":"text","jp":"「太一は、食べ物とかは平気なんだよね？」","en":"“You're doing all right for food, aren't you?”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800855","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00016","en":"Tomoki: \"Taichi, you been alright as far as food and that stuff, right?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:00000681:text","row":30051,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"「まあな。今のところ困ってない」","en":"“Yeah. No trouble so far.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800856","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00017","en":"Taichi: \"Eh, well. Got no worries in the immediate.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:000006c1:text","row":30052,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"「一週間もてばいいし」","en":"“It only has to last a week.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800857","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00018","en":"Taichi: \"I should be fine if I can get through the one week.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:00000775:text","row":30053,"ordinal":19,"kind":"text","jp":"「は？」","en":"“Huh?”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800858","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00019","en":"Tomoki: \"Huh?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:0000079d:text","row":30054,"ordinal":20,"kind":"text","jp":"「こっちの話だよ、キミィ」","en":"“Never mind that, my boy.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800859","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00020","en":"Taichi: \"Just talking to myself, reallyyy!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:000007d7:text","row":30055,"ordinal":21,"kind":"text","jp":"「保健室に用事か？」","en":"“Need something in the infirmary?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800860","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00021","en":"Taichi: \"Got something to do in the infirmary?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:00000864:text","row":30056,"ordinal":22,"kind":"text","jp":"友貴の顔がひきつった。","en":"Tomoki's face tightens.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800861","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00022","en":"Tomoki's face twitched.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:000008b7:text","row":30057,"ordinal":23,"kind":"text","jp":"「ノ、ノー」","en":"“N-No.”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800862","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00023","en":"Tomoki: \"NO-, NOO (No).\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:000008db:text","row":30058,"ordinal":24,"kind":"text","jp":"なんで英語やねん。","en":"What was with the English?","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800863","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00024","en":"What's up with the English.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:0000090d:text","row":30059,"ordinal":25,"kind":"text","jp":"「隠し事があると見た」","en":"“I see a secret.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800864","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00025","en":"Taichi: \"Then what I saw is a secret.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","logical_relation"],"assessment":"The Japanese means that the speaker judges the other person to be hiding something; the English instead treats what was seen as itself a secret.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":38,"start":0,"text":"Taichi: \"Then what I saw is a secret.\""}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:000009c1:text","row":30060,"ordinal":26,"kind":"text","jp":"「ないと見た」","en":"“I see no secret.”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800865","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00026","en":"Tomoki: \"You saw nothing.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","wordplay"],"assessment":"The reply echoes the prior construction to deny that there is a secret; 'You saw nothing' changes both the proposition and the verbal joke.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":26,"start":0,"text":"Tomoki: \"You saw nothing.\""}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:000009ef:text","row":30061,"ordinal":27,"kind":"text","jp":"「……保健室、友貴、放課後、童貞……この四つのキーワードから導きだれる結論とは……」","en":"“...Infirmary. Tomoki. After school. Virginity... What conclusion follows from these four keywords...?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800866","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00027","en":"Taichi: \"...infirmary, Tomoki, afterschool, virginity... and the conclusion that these four keywords lead to is...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:00000a5b:text","row":30062,"ordinal":28,"kind":"text","jp":"推理の時だった。","en":"It was time to deduce.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800867","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00028","en":"It was time for inference.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:00000b09:text","row":30063,"ordinal":29,"kind":"text","jp":"「いや、童貞関係ないから」","en":"“Virginity has nothing to do with this.”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800868","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00029","en":"Taichi: \"No, virginity's unrelated.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["wrong_subject","name_address"],"assessment":"The Japanese source labels this line as Tomoki's dialogue; the English assigns it to Taichi.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":6,"start":0,"text":"Taichi"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:00000b43:text","row":30064,"ordinal":30,"kind":"text","jp":"「難問だな。こんな時はメタ推理だ」","en":"“A tough case. Time for meta-deduction.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800869","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00030","en":"Taichi: \"A difficult question this. When things are like that, it's time for Meta-Inference.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:00000c03:text","row":30065,"ordinal":31,"kind":"text","jp":"「また変なこと言いだした」","en":"“There you go saying weird things again.”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800870","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00031","en":"Tomoki: \"You're blurting out weird stuff again.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:00000c3d:text","row":30066,"ordinal":32,"kind":"text","jp":"「多世界敷衍(ふえん)推理！」","en":"“Many-Worlds Extrapolative Deduction!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800871","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00032","en":"Taichi: \"Many Worlds Belabored Inference!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:00000c79:text","row":30067,"ordinal":33,"kind":"text","jp":"「これは各要素から派生する無数の可能性の全てを並列して思考し、それら無限の選択肢の中からもっともそれっぽいものを任意に抽出する……量子コンピュータっぽい推理法だ」","en":"“You consider in parallel every one of the countless possibilities branching from each element, then arbitrarily extract the most plausible-looking answer from those infinite options... A quantum-computer-ish method of deduction.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800872","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00033","en":"Taichi: \"That is, arranging parallel all the myriad possibilities derived from each element, elucubrating on them, then extracting arbitrarily from the midst of those limitless alternatives the one most likely... a principle of inference in the style of a quantum computer!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:00000db9:text","row":30068,"ordinal":34,"kind":"text","jp":"「あてずっぽう、と言わないかな、それ」","en":"“Wouldn't you call that a wild guess?”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800873","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00034","en":"Tomoki: \"Can't you just call that guesswork now.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:00000dff:text","row":30069,"ordinal":35,"kind":"text","jp":"「そのためには思考を活性化させる糖分が必要だ。おかしください」","en":"“That requires sugar to activate my thought processes. Snacks, please.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800874","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00035","en":"Taichi: \"And for that purpose, an amount of sugar for thought revitalization is required. The odd candy, please.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:00000e5d:text","row":30070,"ordinal":36,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………」","en":"“…………”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800875","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00036","en":"Tomoki: \"......\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:00000e89:text","row":30071,"ordinal":37,"kind":"text","jp":"「ギブミーガム、キブミーチョコレート」","en":"“Give me gum, give me chocolate.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800876","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00037","en":"Taichi: \"GIB MII GUM, GIB MII CHOCOLEETO.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:00000f4d:text","row":30072,"ordinal":38,"kind":"text","jp":"「……太一、いつもあめ玉とか持ってるのに……」","en":"“...Taichi, you always carry hard candy and things...”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800877","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00038","en":"Tomoki: \"...but you always carry candy around, Taichi...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:00000f9b:text","row":30073,"ordinal":39,"kind":"text","jp":"「あれは血糖値が下がったときの緊急用」","en":"“Those are emergency supplies for when my blood sugar drops.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800878","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00039","en":"Taichi: \"That is for emergency cases of dropping blood sugar level only.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:0000105f:text","row":30074,"ordinal":40,"kind":"text","jp":"「糖尿病か」","en":"“What are you, diabetic?”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800879","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00040","en":"Tomoki: \"You got diabetes or something?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:00001083:text","row":30075,"ordinal":41,"kind":"text","jp":"友貴はポケットをごそごそと漁る。","en":"Tomoki rummages through his pockets.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800880","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00041","en":"Tomoki fishes in his pocket, rustling.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:000010bb:text","row":30076,"ordinal":42,"kind":"text","jp":"今や食い物だったら友貴である。","en":"If it's food you need, these days Tomoki is your man.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800881","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00042","en":"At present, if it's about food then it's about Tomoki.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:000010f1:text","row":30077,"ordinal":43,"kind":"text","jp":"いや、もはや、友貴が、食い物なのである！","en":"No. By now, Tomoki himself is food!","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800882","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00043","en":">                                                     Tomoki ga, kuimono nano de aru!\nNo... by now... Tomoki...  Tomoki is food!","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:00001131:text","row":30078,"ordinal":44,"kind":"text","jp":"……んなバカな。","en":"...As if.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800883","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00044","en":"...dumm'ass I am.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","register_voice"],"assessment":"The Japanese rejects the preceding idea as absurd; the English instead calls the narrator a fool.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":17,"start":0,"text":"...dumm'ass I am."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:000011df:text","row":30079,"ordinal":45,"kind":"text","jp":"「ほら」","en":"“Here.”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800884","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00045","en":"Tomoki: \"Here.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:000011ff:text","row":30080,"ordinal":46,"kind":"text","jp":"本当にガムとチョコレートが出てきた。","en":"He really does produce gum and chocolate.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800885","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00046","en":"He seriously produced some chewing gum and chocolate.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:00001243:text","row":30081,"ordinal":47,"kind":"text","jp":"「おまえ、すごいヤツだな」","en":"“You're incredible.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800886","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00047","en":"Taichi: \"You're an amazing fella ain'tcha.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:000012fb:text","row":30082,"ordinal":48,"kind":"text","jp":"「え……何が？　つうか、自分で欲しいって言ったんじゃないか」","en":"“What...? Why? You asked me for them.”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800887","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00048","en":"Tomoki: \"Eh... what? Really, you said yourself you wanted them didn't you.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:00001357:text","row":30083,"ordinal":49,"kind":"text","jp":"「これで俺の特殊な脳みそも安泰だ」","en":"“My special brain is safe now.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800888","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00049","en":"Taichi: \"With these, my peculiar brain matter is also at peace.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:000013b6:text","row":30084,"ordinal":50,"kind":"text","jp":"「？？？」","en":"“???”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800889","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00050","en":"Tomoki: \"???\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:000013d8:text","row":30085,"ordinal":51,"kind":"text","jp":"ガムとチョコレート。","en":"Gum and chocolate.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800890","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00051","en":"Chewing Gum and chocolate:","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:00001404:text","row":30086,"ordinal":52,"kind":"text","jp":"同時に口に放り込む。","en":"I dump them both into my mouth at once.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800891","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00052","en":"they are both simultaneously tossed into the mouth.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:000014b6:text","row":30087,"ordinal":53,"kind":"text","jp":"「うげっ」","en":"“Ugh.”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800892","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00053","en":"Tomoki: \"Ughyack!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:000014e0:text","row":30088,"ordinal":54,"kind":"text","jp":"「同時に味わうとうまい」","en":"“They're good together.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800893","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00054","en":"Taichi: \"Their simultaneous flavor is delicious.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:00001596:text","row":30089,"ordinal":55,"kind":"text","jp":"「そ……」","en":"“Uh...”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800894","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00055","en":"Tomoki: \"Right...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:000015b8:text","row":30090,"ordinal":56,"kind":"text","jp":"呆れていた。","en":"He sounds exasperated.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800895","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00056","en":"Disgusted.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:000015e4:text","row":30091,"ordinal":57,"kind":"text","jp":"「推理の続きなんだけどさ」","en":"“Anyway, back to the deduction.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800896","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00057","en":"Taichi: \"But the inference continues nonetheless.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:0000161e:text","row":30092,"ordinal":58,"kind":"text","jp":"「怪我でもしたのか？」","en":"“Did someone get hurt?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800897","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00058","en":"Taichi: \"Are there injuries anywhere?\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["wrong_subject","grammar"],"assessment":"The Japanese asks whether a person was hurt; the English turns this into an impersonal question about injuries anywhere.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":38,"start":0,"text":"Taichi: \"Are there injuries anywhere?\""}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:000016ad:text","row":30093,"ordinal":59,"kind":"text","jp":"少し驚く友貴。","en":"Tomoki looks slightly surprised.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800898","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00059","en":"Tomoki is somewhat surprised.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:000016d3:text","row":30094,"ordinal":60,"kind":"text","jp":"すぐ皮肉げな表情に、取ってかわられる。","en":"The surprise immediately gives way to a sardonic look.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800899","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00060","en":"It is immediately replaced by a face that feels sarcastic.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:00001797:text","row":30095,"ordinal":61,"kind":"text","jp":"「そう……怪我、したんだ」","en":"“Yeah... someone got hurt.”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800900","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00061","en":"Tomoki: \"Yeah... injury, there's that.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","grammar"],"assessment":"The Japanese confirms that someone was injured; the English fragment does not state that event.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":39,"start":0,"text":"Tomoki: \"Yeah... injury, there's that.\""}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:000017ee:text","row":30096,"ordinal":62,"kind":"text","jp":"「……いい気味だよ」","en":"“...Serves them right.”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800901","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00062","en":"Tomoki: \"...serves 'er right.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:00001822:text","row":30097,"ordinal":63,"kind":"text","jp":"「はい？」","en":"“What?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800902","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00063","en":"Taichi: \"What?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:00001869:text","row":30098,"ordinal":64,"kind":"text","jp":"「……なんでもないから。じゃあね」","en":"“...It's nothing. See you.”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800903","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00064","en":"Tomoki: \"...'s nothing. See ya.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:0000195b:text","row":30099,"ordinal":65,"kind":"text","jp":"去っていく。","en":"He walks away.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800904","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00065","en":"He leaves.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:00001987:text","row":30100,"ordinal":66,"kind":"text","jp":"「ふーむ」","en":"“Hmm.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800905","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00066","en":"Taichi: \"Uh-huh.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:000019a9:text","row":30101,"ordinal":67,"kind":"text","jp":"ガムごと、チョコを嚥下する。","en":"I swallow the chocolate, gum and all.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800906","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00067","en":"I swallow the chewing gum together with the chocolate.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:000019dd:text","row":30102,"ordinal":68,"kind":"text","jp":"俺はガム食う属性の人だ。","en":"I possess the gum-eater attribute.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800907","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00068","en":"I'm a person with the Swallows Chewing Gum Character Attribute.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0220:00001a15:text","row":30103,"ordinal":69,"kind":"text","jp":"「……怪我というより、心の病気の方だったか」","en":"“...Maybe it was less an injury than a sickness of the heart.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800908","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0040:00069","en":"Taichi: \"...perhaps, rather than injury, I should have called it a disease of the heart.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["idiom_calque","word_choice"],"assessment":"The Japanese phrase refers to a psychological or mental illness; the highlighted calque suggests a cardiac or romantic condition.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":87,"start":67,"text":"disease of the heart"}]}]}]}
